00:05:31.942 --> 00:05:33.340
Speaker 3: Campaign ads.

00:05:33.340 --> 00:05:34.340
OK, OK.

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:37.010
Speaker 1: Did you have any issues like on?

00:05:37.010 --> 00:05:38.010
There was this video.

00:05:38.010 --> 00:05:41.770
There was a picture of some guy all maggot
out working the polls.

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:43.419
You didn't have anything like that.

00:05:43.419 --> 00:05:45.710
Speaker 3: That's good.

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:46.710
Yeah.

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:47.710
Thankfully not.

00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:48.710
Yeah.

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:54.840
But we were in a rural area in New Jersey,
so like close to the Pine Barrens.

00:05:54.840 --> 00:06:01.469
So maybe you would have that in the like in
a big city, maybe or or in a suburban area?

00:06:01.469 --> 00:06:02.469
OK.

00:06:02.469 --> 00:06:05.150
That's what I want.

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:10.669
We were in teams like you couldn't just be
a poll worker and not have a like, I was in

00:06:10.669 --> 00:06:16.759
