to be a Great Dane.

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:33.669
And she was such a what was it?

00:06:33.669 --> 00:06:38.270
She was definitely the opposite of a low information
person, like she was very spartan, but she's

00:06:38.270 --> 00:06:40.660
