00:07:05.831 --> 00:07:06.870
In other words, isn't it?

00:07:06.870 --> 00:07:07.870
What is it?

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:10.210
Because there's supposed to be a split of
Democrats and Republicans?

00:07:10.210 --> 00:07:11.470
Speaker 3: Yes.

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:12.470
