00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:16.219
If you return, I was responsible for returning
the ballots, right?

00:07:16.219 --> 00:07:18.490
And you can't do that by yourself.

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:20.830
You have to have a fair delegation.

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:24.389
So you have to have a Republican and a Democrat.

00:07:24.389 --> 00:07:25.389
Got it.

00:07:25.389 --> 00:07:26.389
Got it.

00:07:26.389 --> 00:07:27.389
All right.

00:07:27.389 --> 00:07:28.949
Well, it
Speaker 1: sounds like it was a good experience

00:07:28.949 --> 00:07:32.069
