00:07:35.379 --> 00:07:36.379
Speaker 1: Thank you.

00:07:36.379 --> 00:07:37.379
All right, Michael from Berlin, New Jersey.

00:07:37.379 --> 00:07:38.650
Great to hear from you.

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:44.000
A lot of people, in fact in the audience,
emailed me and said, David, I was a poll worker

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.000
here.

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:46.330
I was a poll worker there.

00:07:46.330 --> 00:09:04.690
Quite quite compelling stuff.

